     <td><para unique="1046777">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1046778">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+133388"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046780">Converts 8 packed quad-word integers from zmm2 into 8 packed double-word integers in ymm1/m256 with truncation subject to writemask k1.</para>
